{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "3398170e69ba9c1651d0ba019c7bf18c85bbf723f46fb840aa9f26c969101430", "ja": "今回も、お芝居で悪役を演じるだけで。\nアイドルのみんなは、とってもいい子たちだし。", "zh": "这次也只是在戏里演反派而已。\n偶像们都是非常乖的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "0077877116e7830819abc85191fec3904574e3e19f2f12c15510966c27131cd9", "ja": "{$P$}さんも音無先輩も\nとっても優しいし……うーん、ちょいワルな人……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生和音无前辈也\n都非常温柔……唔，有点坏心眼的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "53e0f865cab858db7bbe56a9ef8104c57895cf75bff5473e20098ceb5332216d", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。社長と音無さんが……ん？\nあの、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。社长和音无小姐……嗯？那个，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "26eae539204d113b700b0515964c97d4af12b8122952083d5da81546101b2134", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nいえ、何でもないんです。ちょっと考え事を……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n没什么，只是在想事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1005_101kot", "source_sha256": "1f02c36b219ac2babbfde2cb4d3986ecd602df08b1937ae0fad4b587a885315c", "ja": "もう社長ったら。目を離すとすぐ悪さを\nするんですから。いけないんですよ、本当に！", "zh": "真是的，社长这个人。稍微一移开视线，\n就会立刻做坏事。真的不可以这样啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1006_president", "source_sha256": "29e5e15a214f14e90b15c1441e686037bc5bf0d17b0d4bdd1e66d0e638246001", "ja": "なぁに、昨夜のあれくらい、悪さのうちに入らないよ。\n音無君は心配し過ぎじゃないかね？", "zh": "没什么，昨晚那点事，哪算得上胡闹啊。  \n音无小姐是不是太担心了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "092a5a956ad2398909611c222828f8b9ba168fd1cc8976ddc504e5582e06999f", "ja": "社長さん、音無先輩、お疲れさまです！\n悪さ……社長さん、もしかしてちょいワル……！？", "zh": "社长，音无前辈，辛苦了！\n坏事……社长，该不会是有点坏坏的……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a42d326d87d160540f2e00ebadaef5df0ada44d9e8b563aff56f29f18a500dc4", "ja": "お疲れさまです。\n……ちょいワル？", "zh": "辛苦了。\n……有点坏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "5aff57b97e76fdd55c896d5d825031526d0a9993953260d2c11106d905d1fbcd", "ja": "ちょいワルもちょいワルですよ！　社長ったら、\n昨日も糖質と脂質の多い食事をしていて……。", "zh": "就算是“小坏”也确实是“小坏”哦！社长真是的，昨天也吃了富含碳水化合物和脂肪的饭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "9277494e0f03646771c1692ffd818f11286f4cef70a5be140528f9338bf44300", "ja": "コレステロールや尿酸値がどうなっても知りませんよ？\nお野菜も摂って、バランスよく食べないと！", "zh": "胆固醇和尿酸值要是变成什么样，我可不管哦？蔬菜也要吃，饮食必须均衡！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "af093f4de805f7e05ef03e95b709a7b72dfefdb5857418070b247a1841567c40", "ja": "そうだったんですか。仕事上の会食も多いとは\n思いますが……体は大事にしてくださいね。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。虽然工作上的应酬也很多……但请一定要保重身体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e68bccc988930cb0e89522a8de14ddab02f7ee18087afe40584765235afd1a00", "ja": "やっぱり社長には、765プロの大黒柱として\nどーんと構えていていただきたいですから！", "zh": "果然还是希望您作为765Pro的顶梁柱，稳稳当当地撑住公司啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "5b1fd5a7fd4cd1b99351a460194f715e3d43595706bfc6122c7a5f6ada2a9be0", "ja": "うーむ、君にそう言われると弱いな……わかった！\n今後はもう少し、健康に気をつけるようにしよう！", "zh": "唔，被你这么一说我就没辙了……好吧！\n今后我会多注意一下健康的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "245231dfd2d5bf4db70a5f96387058406299397d911522f89ceb8f986cd2a9ca", "ja": "そうですね、健康第一です！　……ふふっ。\n私の想像してた、ちょいワルとは違ったみたい。", "zh": "没错，健康第一！……呵呵。\n好像和我想象中的那种小坏蛋不太一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "bfc589ddebeb2c5a017ec06f142282c7c6ac0ebe777c2ddd0d9e18fdabd3870f", "ja": "ちょいワルといえば……今日のゲネプロも、\nなかなかのワルが活躍する舞台のようだね？", "zh": "说到坏孩子风格……今天的彩排，似乎也是一场由相当厉害的坏家伙大显身手的舞台呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "a7bba5d93515d1052aa0bf89944560dbd43d7bc4f1a757a31a09e55db2d0daf4", "ja": "たしか、全員が悪役なんですよね？　みんなが\nどんな演技を披露してくれるか、楽しみですね！", "zh": "我记得，这次好像所有人都是反派吧？真期待大家会带来怎样的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1017_102mis", "source_sha256": "373034bce05ac511e416374bd8d184d77f4f68a94c13d66320fb22cdd2351f82", "ja": "はい！　私も今回の舞台を見て、\nちょいワルを勉強したいと思います！", "zh": "好的！我也想通过观看这次的舞台，学习一下如何演绎小恶棍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "375c8a37afe8487f3fccb843e2540b79c186cc7af0eff240ae77ffca06919f60", "ja": "ええ。みんな頑張っていましたから、きっと\n雰囲気が出せていると思います。早速行きましょう！", "zh": "是的。大家都很努力，一定已经营造出那种氛围了。我们马上过去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1019_102mis", "source_sha256": "4e715e7f19e3cb2416d9c5f79639d5640393407bd5dbce4ab6c828fc8e11ac61", "ja": "お待たせいたしました。SHADE OF SPADE\nゲネプロ上演、これより開始となります。", "zh": "让大家久等了。SHADE OF SPADE的彩排演出，现在开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_intro_1020_102mis", "source_sha256": "6bbd46ce51d9fcb7b94dd5f26e241a01951c7ae6d4b1e35c06054f7071612891", "ja": "765プロに宿る冷厳なる力、\nぜひその目でご鑑賞ください！", "zh": "寄宿于765艺能的冷严之力，\n请务必亲眼一睹为快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
